From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:48:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 2608 (tester 55922): the match offer keeps its two buttons
 when the model words it

The model made the offer itself ("this matches Gia's need, shall I
introduce you?"), so the server rightly added no second line, and with
that line it also dropped the two buttons. A reply that already names the
person in need and asks a question now keeps its words and gets the two
approved buttons; one that only names them, asking nothing, gets none.
No new text: the buttons are the ones approved with BR.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
